Round-25 (2026-08-08): the member-alias own-parameter capture fix
([temp.local]/1, pointer_traits/allocator_traits rebind chains) makes
substantially more container machinery convert; the object count
crossed 2^8, so --object-bits 12 (the libc++-suite standard) is now
required.
